um,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 나. 기술애로해결계획서 : </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"><strong>2021. 5. 24.(월) ~ 2021.  6.&nbsp;25.(금)&nbsp;</strong></span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">&nbsp;</span><br><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><br><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"><strong>&nbsp;3. 제출방법 </strong></span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">:</span><strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"> </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">온라인  제출</span></strong></strong><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"> </span><br><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; </span><a href=\"http://www.smtech.go.kr/\"><u><font color=\"#0066cc\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">http://www.smtech.go.kr</span></font></u></a><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"> 사이트 회원가입(기업),  </span><br><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 기업체대표 및 실무담당자 회원가입 必</span><br><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><br><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"><strong>&nbsp;4. 사업 내용 및 양식  </strong></span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">: 상세내용 붙임 파일 참조&nbsp;</span><br><strong></strong><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><br><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size